# Deploy receipts (generated by scripts/deploy.ts) — regenerated per run, never commit.
deploy-receipts/

# Alchemy's local state store (Alchemy.localState(), see alchemy.run.ts). It
# holds the deployed resource graph INCLUDING every secret the deploy read
# through `Config`, in cleartext (alchemy StateEncoding.ts:71-91). Never commit
# it; treat the directory like a credential file. `.alchemy/log/` and
# `.alchemy/version-check.json` land here too.
.alchemy/
